    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/b24cdd92577955f0c130d30697c6b2c8.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/b24cdd92577955f0c130d30697c6b2c8.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/b24cdd92577955f0c130d30697c6b2c8.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In\u00a0<strong>Life is a Journey,</strong> you<strong>\u00a0</strong></i>set off on an unforgettable adventure in your van, where every mile is a new experience! \ud83d\ude90\u2728 Build and upgrade your campervan, customizing it to fit your lifestyle. This isn\u2019t just a vehicle \u2013 it\u2019s your home on wheels. Take care of it, improve it, and transform it to conquer every road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into the shoes of a lone traveler venturing into the unknown, where every step tells a story. In this immersive blend of a relaxing simulator and light survival mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/eaa32b86d9f6a93fd85c9f6bcff34c83.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/eaa32b86d9f6a93fd85c9f6bcff34c83.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/eaa32b86d9f6a93fd85c9f6bcff34c83.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, travel, explore \u2013 embrace the van life and live like a true nomad. The world is your playground, and your camper is the key to endless adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/42f0d5ec95fb6027a77c509f729935d9.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/42f0d5ec95fb6027a77c509f729935d9.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/42f0d5ec95fb6027a77c509f729935d9.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to enjoy the scenery, set up camp under the stars, and interact with the world at your own pace. Whether you follow a distant landmark or let your curiosity guide you, the journey itself is what matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campervan</strong> \u2013 Build, repair, and customize your van to fit your lifestyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Explore breathtaking landscapes that change with time and weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing yet Engaging Gameplay</strong> \u2013 A perfect mix of peaceful exploration and light survival mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp &amp; Rest</strong> \u2013 Set up your own campsites, cook meals, and gather resources to sustain your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Exploration</strong> \u2013 Every path you take reveals new stories, mysteries, and hidden wonders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI, Maximum Immersion</strong> \u2013 Let the environment be your guide as you navigate without distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey Without Limits</strong> \u2013 No rush, no pressure\u2014just the freedom to explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take the first step on your unforgettable journey?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/b24cdd92577955f0c130d30697c6b2c8.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/b24cdd92577955f0c130d30697c6b2c8.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/b24cdd92577955f0c130d30697c6b2c8.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In\u00a0<strong>Life is a Journey,</strong> you<strong>\u00a0</strong></i>set off on an unforgettable adventure in your van, where every mile is a new experience! \ud83d\ude90\u2728 Build and upgrade your campervan, customizing it to fit your lifestyle. This isn\u2019t just a vehicle \u2013 it\u2019s your home on wheels. Take care of it, improve it, and transform it to conquer every road ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Step into the shoes of a lone traveler venturing into the unknown, where every step tells a story. In this immersive blend of a relaxing simulator and light survival mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/eaa32b86d9f6a93fd85c9f6bcff34c83.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/eaa32b86d9f6a93fd85c9f6bcff34c83.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/eaa32b86d9f6a93fd85c9f6bcff34c83.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, travel, explore \u2013 embrace the van life and live like a true nomad. The world is your playground, and your camper is the key to endless adventures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/42f0d5ec95fb6027a77c509f729935d9.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/42f0d5ec95fb6027a77c509f729935d9.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/42f0d5ec95fb6027a77c509f729935d9.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your time to enjoy the scenery, set up camp under the stars, and interact with the world at your own pace. Whether you follow a distant landmark or let your curiosity guide you, the journey itself is what matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campervan</strong> \u2013 Build, repair, and customize your van to fit your lifestyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Explore breathtaking landscapes that change with time and weather.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing yet Engaging Gameplay</strong> \u2013 A perfect mix of peaceful exploration and light survival mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camp &amp; Rest</strong> \u2013 Set up your own campsites, cook meals, and gather resources to sustain your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Exploration</strong> \u2013 Every path you take reveals new stories, mysteries, and hidden wonders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimal UI, Maximum Immersion</strong> \u2013 Let the environment be your guide as you navigate without distractions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey Without Limits</strong> \u2013 No rush, no pressure\u2014just the freedom to explore at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.poster.avif?t=1749860090\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.webm?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3618320/extras/70dc0fd9b2bbd94b38c3e73d2e09b23b.mp4?t=1749860090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take the first step on your unforgettable journey?</p>",
